33	// The known command names live in cli.cpp (is_subcommand): the parser needs
34	// them for the default-command rule, so parse_cli only ever yields run/list/
35	// doctor (or "" for no args / top-level help). Developer build/test/state-diff
36	// tooling lives in scripts/, not the binary.
